# NestJS GRPC Backend Module Style

Orchestrates work across the shared-types library and `src/modules`. Follow the linked RPC rules for each artifact — do not infer structure from other files.

## Shared types library (`src/libs/**/`)

Create or update **before** the backend module when adding a new entity.

| Artifact               | Path                                                       | Rule                               |
| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Proto module (4 files) | `src/proto/<module>/`                                      | `nestjs-proto-generation.mdc`      |
| DTOs                   | `src/classes/<module>/dto/` (`create`, `update`, `params`) | `nestjs-rpc-dto-generation.mdc`    |
| Filters                | `src/classes/<module>/filters/<module>.filter.ts`          | `nestjs-rpc-filter-generation.mdc` |
| Generated types        | `src/generated/<module>/`                                  | generated from proto — do not edit |

- Proto folder: snake_case (`knowledge_group`). Class folder: kebab-case (`knowledge-group`).
- Use `@shared/generated/<module>/model` for responses (`{Entity}Model`, `Array{Entity}Response`, `Status{Entity}Response`) — do not add `response/` or `*.response.ts` under `src/modules`.

## Backend module (`src/modules/<module>/`)

Rules for files/folder:

- `entities/<module>.entity.ts` (+ repository) - `nestjs-typeorm-entity-generation.mdc`
- `<module>.service.ts` - `nestjs-rpc-service-generation.mdc`
- `<module>.controller.ts` - implement generated `{Entity}ServiceController` from `@shared/generated/<module>/service`; mirror existing controllers(`@*ServiceControllerMethods()`, `@RpcServiceAuth`, `@Payload()`, `@Ctx()`, `@RpcAuth()`)
- `query-builders/` - always create the query builder for the entity (`export class KnowledgeGroupQueryBuilder extends AppQueryBuilder<KnowledgeGroup> {}`)
- `<module>.module.ts` | register entity repository + service in `providers`; export service

Imports in module code:

- DTOs / filters: `@shared/classes/<kebab-module>/…`
- gRPC models / service interfaces: `@shared/generated/<module>/…`

## Database

- Never create any migration files for the database.
